# Ashley Furniture – Product Data Extraction

## Project Overview

This project is a **web scraping and browser automation project** developed as part of a Technical / Data Research Assignment for **Ashley Furniture**.

The objective is to collect product information for **198 SKUs**, validate the extracted data, and save the results in Excel.

## Problem Statement

The provided Excel file contains 198 Ashley Furniture product SKUs. Manually searching each SKU and collecting product information can be time-consuming and may lead to data-entry errors.

The required information includes:

* SKU
* Product URL
* Image
* Description
* Color
* Price
* Series Name
* UPC
* Product Dimensions
* Carton Dimensions

## Solution

I developed a Python-based Selenium automation workflow to reduce manual work.

```text
Excel File
    ↓
Read SKU
    ↓
Search Ashley Furniture
    ↓
Find Product Page
    ↓
Validate SKU
    ↓
Extract Product Information
    ↓
Save to Excel
```

The automation handles:

* Reading SKUs from Excel
* Opening Ashley Furniture
* Handling the location popup
* Handling cookie popup
* Searching for SKUs
* Finding matching product URLs
* Opening product pages
* Validating SKUs
* Extracting basic product information
* Saving results to Excel

## Technologies Used

* Python
* Selenium
* Pandas
* OpenPyXL
* Excel
* Web Scraping
* Browser Automation

## Initial Challenge

Initially, I tried using Python `requests` to access Ashley Furniture product pages.

The website returned **HTTP 406** and did not provide useful page content.

Because of this, I changed the approach to **Selenium browser automation**.

## Test Results

### SKU Search Test

Tested SKU: `R407681`

The automation successfully:

* Connected to Chrome
* Handled the Ashley location popup
* Accepted cookies
* Searched for the SKU
* Found the matching product URL

### Product Extraction Test

Tested SKU: `A4000462`

```text
Excel SKU:   A4000462
Website SKU: A4000462
SKU Match:   True

Product: Ryandale Accent Table
Price: $249.99
Rating: 4.8
```

The extracted result was successfully saved to the Excel output file.

## Current Challenge

Ashley Furniture sometimes displays a human-verification popup during product-page navigation.

```text
Press & Hold to confirm you are a human.
```

This interrupts the automation and currently affects continuous processing of all 198 SKUs.

The verification was not bypassed.

