## Conclusion

The core web scraping and Selenium automation workflow has been successfully developed and tested.

The project can read SKUs from Excel, search Ashley Furniture, handle common website popups, identify product URLs, validate SKUs, extract basic product information, and save the results to Excel.

The main remaining challenge is the intermittent human-verification popup, which affects continuous processing of all 198 SKUs.
